  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When shutting down the Fedora webapp (one-click and Tomcat), the following stacktrace is emitted to the console log:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "```",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]: Exception in thread \"Thread-10\" java.lang.NoClassDefFoundError: org/h2/mvstore/MVMap$2",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.h2.mvstore.MVMap.entrySet(MVMap.java:793)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.h2.mvstore.db.LobStorageMap.removeAllForTable(LobStorageMap.java:302)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.h2.engine.Database.removeOrphanedLobs(Database.java:1489)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.h2.engine.Database.closeImpl(Database.java:1416)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.h2.engine.Database.close(Database.java:1373)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.h2.engine.OnExitDatabaseCloser.onShutdown(OnExitDatabaseCloser.java:85)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.h2.engine.OnExitDatabaseCloser.run(OnExitDatabaseCloser.java:114)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]: Caused by: java.lang.ClassNotFoundException: Illegal access: this web application instance has been stopped already. Could not load [org.h2.mvstore.MVMap$2]. The following stack trace is thrown for debugging purposes as well as to attempt to terminate the thread which caused the illegal access.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.checkStateForClassLoading(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1375)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.loadClass(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1226)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.loadClass(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1188)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         ... 7 more",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]: Caused by: java.lang.IllegalStateException: Illegal access: this web application instance has been stopped already. Could not load [org.h2.mvstore.MVMap$2]. The following stack trace is thrown for debugging purposes as well as to attempt to terminate the thread which caused the illegal access.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.checkStateForResourceLoading(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1385)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.checkStateForClassLoading(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1373)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9[1437]:         ... 9 more",
       "type": "text"
