  "description": "<p>When shutting down the Fedora webapp (one-click and Tomcat), the following stacktrace is emitted to the console log:<br/>\n```<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>: Exception in thread \"Thread-10\" java.lang.NoClassDefFoundError: org/h2/mvstore/MVMap$2<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.h2.mvstore.MVMap.entrySet(MVMap.java:793)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.h2.mvstore.db.LobStorageMap.removeAllForTable(LobStorageMap.java:302)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.h2.engine.Database.removeOrphanedLobs(Database.java:1489)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.h2.engine.Database.closeImpl(Database.java:1416)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.h2.engine.Database.close(Database.java:1373)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.h2.engine.OnExitDatabaseCloser.onShutdown(OnExitDatabaseCloser.java:85)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.h2.engine.OnExitDatabaseCloser.run(OnExitDatabaseCloser.java:114)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>: Caused by: java.lang.ClassNotFoundException: Illegal access: this web application instance has been stopped already. Could not load <span class=\"error\">&#91;org.h2.mvstore.MVMap$2&#93;</span>. The following stack trace is thrown for debugging purposes as well as to attempt to terminate the thread which caused the illegal access.<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.checkStateForClassLoading(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1375)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.loadClass(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1226)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.loadClass(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1188)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         ... 7 more<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>: Caused by: java.lang.IllegalStateException: Illegal access: this web application instance has been stopped already. Could not load <span class=\"error\">&#91;org.h2.mvstore.MVMap$2&#93;</span>. The following stack trace is thrown for debugging purposes as well as to attempt to terminate the thread which caused the illegal access.<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.checkStateForResourceLoading(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1385)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         at org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoaderBase.checkStateForClassLoading(WebappClassLoaderBase.java:1373)<br/>\nJul 08 09:56:16 silver tomcat9<span class=\"error\">&#91;1437&#93;</span>:         ... 9 more<br/>\n```</p>",
